    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23560" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάφνη</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sweet bay, Laurus nobilis,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				9.183
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				30
			</span></i>, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Georg.</u>
				36
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τῆς δ.</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρύπανον</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> ἄριστον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					5.9.7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάφναν μὴ δρέπε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
					2.185
				</span></i>
			 (
				Boeot.
			, <span class="entity">v B.C.</span>); [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀπόλλων] χρείων ἐκ δάφνης γυάλων
					ὕπο Παρνησοῖο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Ap.</u>
					396
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ὧν εἶπέ μοι ὁ Φοῖβος . .
					Πυθικὴν σείσας δάφνην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					213
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρέω τι τορώτερον ἢ ἀπὸ δάφνης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Del.</u>
					94
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεφανῶσαι δάφνης στεφάνῳ</span>”
