					2507
				</span></i>
			 (Delph.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
				786
			</span></i> (Halic.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				3641
			</span></i> b <i><span class="en">
				20
			</span></i> (add., Lampsacus). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. Ἀλεξανδρεία,</span>
