			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				1.10.8
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				3.17.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.145
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαμαιδάφνη</span>
			, Ps._<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.147
